messages.body:
Yes! VocBench's SPARQL tab supports full SPARQL 1.1 including property paths. Here's a query that should work:

```sparql
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>

SELECT ?concept WHERE {
  ?concept a skos:Concept .
  ?concept skos:broader{3,} ?topConcept .
  FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?narrower skos:broader ?concept }
}
```

You can run this in the SPARQL tab under the 'Advanced' menu. The {3,} means 3 or more skos:broader relations in the path.
